<title>SPAIN: Spain's Argentaria head buys small stake.</title>
<headline>Spain's Argentaria head buys small stake.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain's Corporacion Bancaria de Espana (Argentaria) said on Tuesday its chairman Francisco Gonzalez bought 42,000 shares in the banking group, or 0.034 percent of its share capital.</p>
<p>A spokesman said the deal is a first step aimed at creating a group of core shareholders.</p>
<p>Gonzalez paid a total of 246 million pesetas, or 5,850 pesetas per share. He also bought 193,021 five-year options for 200 million pesetas.</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom, + 341 585 8340</p>
</text>
